cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "agent-harness-evals"
type: dataset
abstract: >-
  A continuously-updated aggregation and reconciliation layer over AI
  evaluation leaderboards, exposing the model x harness matrix that model-only
  leaderboards hide. Data fetched from the Epoch AI Benchmarking Hub (CC-BY),
  normalized into a unified (benchmark, model, scaffold, score) schema.
authors:
  - name: "agent-harness-evals contributors"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - agent evaluation
  - harness
  - benchmark
  - model leaderboard
  - reconciliation
repository-code: "https://github.com/alloevil/agent-harness-evals"
url: "https://alloevil.github.io/agent-harness-evals/"
